WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 2 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:08.650
How dare you touch my dragon egg!

2
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.150
Mr. Thorn, wait! I swear I was just dusting it!

3
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.350
I got jumped in the courtyard, my nose was bleeding and it just cracked!

4
00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:22.270
I risked my life smuggling the sovereign egg out of the deep ruins.

5
00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:27.570
It carries the most ancient lethal bloodline in existence.

6
00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:29.770
And the damn thing rejected me.

7
00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:32.970
I nearly burnt alive, just brushing its scales.

8
00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.270
He's tossing it around like cobblestone.

9
00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:38.270
The egg has already submitted to his blood.

10
00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.270
It's warm.

11
00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:41.270
I think something's moving inside.

12
00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:43.270
Mr. Thorn, please, check it!

13
00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.270
No! Keep it just to stay exactly where you are.

14
00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.270
You're right. It's patching season.

15
00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:51.270
So a baby dragon is coming?

16
00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:54.270
Does this mean it actually chose me?

17
00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:56.270
Could I actually make the rider classes?

18
00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:59.270
With your bloodline, who the hell is qualified to teach you?

19
00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:03.270
Besides, no rider in the realm can tame the monster inside that shell.

20
00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:04.270
Don't be delusional.

21
00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:06.270
Look at it. It's a runt.

22
00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:09.270
It was never meant to be a rider's dragon.

23
00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:13.270
But it could have at least lived a simple happy life.

24
00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:15.270
Now, you've ruined it.

25
00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:18.270
Your blood is poisoning the poor creature.

26
00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:20.270
It won't last the week.

27
00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:25.270
Have you forgotten, since you were a kid, dragons run from you?

28
00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.270
Like you're the Grim Reaper.

29
00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:32.580
You only bring harm to dragons, kid.

30
00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:34.580
That's why I kept you away.

31
00:01:34.580 --> 00:01:39.880
You are right. They hate me.

32
00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:42.880
Hate you? They're terrified of you.

33
00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.880
They smell the dragon god's chosen on you.

34
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:48.880
That's the real reason I kept you away.

35
00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.880
I love dragons. I could never harm them.

36
00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:53.880
Please, tell me how to save the egg.

37
00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.880
Of course. I value dragon lives above my own.

38
00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.880
Listen to me. You must leave.

39
00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:03.880
Immediately. Take the egg to Duke Caspian Valmont.

40
00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:06.880
He's the finest dragon healer on the continent.

41
00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:09.880
Show him my command pin, and the Duke will take you in.

42
00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:15.880
He commands the Obsidian Order, one of the four greatest dragon knight orders in the realm.

43
00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:17.880
It's the dream of every graduate here.

44
00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:20.880
Maybe he can even squeeze you through squire training.

45
00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:23.880
Make a real rider out of you. Barely.

46
00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:26.880
Thank you, Mr. Thorn.

47
00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.880
You took me in off the streets. You raised me.

48
00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.880
And today, you're saving me again.

49
00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.880
You're like a son to me, Aris.

50
00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:39.880
So if you really want to repay me, just remember one thing.

51
00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:43.880
When things go south, leave my name out of it. Understand?

52
00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:56.840
Finally, the walking disaster is gone.

53
00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:58.840
Good boy, Nix.
